 "note": "Unnamed hill park (OSM leisure=park way:490252542, the cell's tier-1 park landmark) west of 심곡성당, about 60 x 62 m between four lanes. The ground is raised above the east street behind a rock retaining wall with hedges; the stair entrance on the east has a green arched polycarbonate canopy (V-World record gis:11185555, building=roof, stays auto). Layers: grass under the canopy, tan walks round the west and north edge, a light-blue shallow basin (splash pool) in the north, a tan plaza round an octagonal dark-roofed pavilion in the middle, a tan south plaza with a round sand playground and a small yellow play structure, grey paving by the stair entrance, a dark rectangle in the SW (court or rubber floor, satellite only), clipped hedges along the north and east street edges. The OSM outline sits on the north, east and south lanes; the ground is moved in to the satellite curb. Trees stay trees.json. custom pxpark.",
